{t:Carol of the Bells}
{artist:}
{key: A}

[Am]Hark! how the bells, 
[G]Sweet silver bells, 
[F]All seem to say
[E]"Throw cares away."
 
[Am]Christmas is here, 
[Am]Bringing good cheer 
[Dm]To young and old,
[Am]Meek and the bold.
 
[Dm]Ding, dong, ding, dong, 
[Am]That is their song 
[Dm]With joyful ring, 
[Am]All caroling.
 
[Dm]One seems to hear 
[Am]Words of good cheer 
[Dm]From everywhere 
[Am]Filling the air;
 
[Dm]Oh how they pound, 
[Am]Raising the sound 
[Dm]O'er hill and dale,
[Am]Telling their tale.
 
[Am]Gailly they ring 
While people sing 
[Dm]Song(s) of good cheer 
Christmas is here
 
[Am]Merry, merry, merry, [Am]merry Christmas! 2x 
 
[Am]On, on they send, 
[Dm]On without end, 
[Am7]Their joyful tone
[Dm]To ev'ry home.
 
[Am]Hark! how the bells, 
Sweet silver bells, 
All seem to say    
"Throw cares away."
 
[Am]On, on they send, 
On without end, 
Their joyful tone
To ev'ry home.
Em- Ding, dong ding dong 

